          %h2#link Link
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C3%B6wenheim%E2%80%93Skolem_theorem"} Löwenheim-Skolem theorem
          %h2#references References
          %ul#MakkaiPare
